# <%= name %>

An independent Contexla Application generated from the Application SDK starter.

The starter demonstrates the required setup, default, and settings surfaces,
plus an optional collection surface. Replace instructional content with a real
business use case; do not turn the package into a generic workflow container.

```powershell
mix deps.get
mix test
mix contexla.application.package
```

This project depends on the Application SDK and `contexla_ui`, never on the
Contexla platform or another concrete Application.
